+   /* tgsi_to_nir sets only `access` on its deref-based image intrinsics;
+    * for the deref form, dim/array/element-type are implied by the
+    * variable's type, so nothing else was needed. The index-based form
+    * carries them explicitly, and nir_rewrite_image_intrinsic() only
